WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
Still researching business
ideas instead of testing one?

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.000
One Small Venture helps you
choose a practical place to start.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.620
Answer fifteen questions
about your time,

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:14.260
skills, working preferences, and the
support you can realistically provide.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.120
Compare a focused service,
a reusable workflow kit,

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.140
a narrow software tool,
or a research product.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.380
See why a route matches your answers
and what tradeoffs come with it.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.840
Then build your fourteen-day
test plan: one buyer,

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.040
one problem, a useful sample,

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.700
and clear limits on
time and spending.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.920
Your answers aren't proof of demand.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.380
They're a starting point
for finding evidence.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:44.240
Take the free One Small Venture quiz and
choose one test you can actually run.
